Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:06.12,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Auditing embedded C firmware in Windows PowerShell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:11.89,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,All 16 automated unit tests pass in 8.7 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:17.66,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,GCC firmware confirms 100% bit-accurate decision parity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.01,0:00:24.43,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 1: Clean Normal Sinus Rhythm (250 Hz dual-stream scope).
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:30.00,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Untouched raw signal displayed alongside candidate-filtered ECG.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:35.58,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,All quality heuristics pass, MIG distortion zero -> ACCEPT triage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:44.92,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 2: Atrial Fibrillation with irregular intervals and f-waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.07,0:00:53.06,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,1D-CNN classifies rhythm on hardware FPU in 34 ms -> ACCEPT AF.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.41,0:01:00.64,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 3: Ventricular Ectopy and Premature Ventricular Contractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:07.02,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Ectopic morphology flagged; raw snippet preserved in 8 MB PSRAM.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:14.81,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 4: Severe Respiratory Drift (Ambulatory Baseline Wander).
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:21.40,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Linear-time quality gate flags wander -> Safely issues ABSTAIN.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.75,0:01:28.30,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 5: High-Frequency Muscle Tremor & EMG Artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.45,0:01:34.00,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Quality gate isolates noise -> Routes recording to REVIEW for safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.35,0:01:40.59,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 6: Disconnected Electrode / Flatline Simulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.74,0:01:45.99,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Zero amplitude detected -> Immediate ABSTAIN (Zero false reassurance).
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:52.67,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 7: ADC Rail Saturation Clipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.82,0:01:58.15,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Amplifier rail limits exceeded -> Immediate ABSTAIN to protect AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:04.77,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Scenario 8: Morphology Integrity Guard (MIG) in Action.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:10.18,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Filter attenuates pacemaker spike -> MIG detects discrepancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.33,0:02:15.60,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Automatic acceptance revoked -> Safely forced to REVIEW.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:26.26,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,Summary: 85.5% coverage, zero missed arrhythmias, 16/16 tests passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:35.71,ModernSub,,0,0,0,,100% bit-accurate firmware parity, $14.10 BOM, 20.7h battery lifetime.
